{"title":"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/5/f359fc5a6e8ae3c94c401530782cc943ff14d0b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r, s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"24\" height=\"11\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> are three different positive integers and that their product is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/f/5afbad0b221f0ef70186fe70b08e6fc1efdd8dfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, i.e., <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/7294f450ca5293c0ca03e8e06ddf00749bef2764.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$rst=48.$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"69\" height=\"13\" />\nWhat is the smallest possible value of the sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/4/3b4d8cb6aa374535cea16c712b70c8f6ba8155ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r+s+t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"67\" height=\"13\" />?\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The solution rst must factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897efc19813fafb27afd517cf918ad0630a7da3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$48=2^{4}\\cdot{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" /> and the numbers must be DISTINCT. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/7/107787196f62a5fbd8484e205d9fb90e1d0c65a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3+4+4=11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"116\" height=\"15\" /> fails the distinct test so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/c/cfc942c1273ec84aa8fd56f4d370e991a2c92201.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+4+6=12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"113\" height=\"14\" /> is the solution.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II\">2010 UNCO Math Contest II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://uncmathcontest.wordpress.com/\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_UNCO_Math_Contest_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 UNCO Math Contest II Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#1